  "body": "### Summary\nAs a member reading the Messages list, I want the filter under the large title to scroll up and away with the list, as it does in a category, so that the screens behave the same way.\n\n### Feedback (operator, 2026-11-17, device)\n- **(C)** In a category, the filter at the top of the page is not pinned: it belongs to the top of the content and scrolls away.\n- In Messages, the filter under the large title (Tous / MP / MP multiples, #899) must do the same: it scrolls up with the page and disappears.\n\n### Scope\n- Read how the category topic list places its filter (the header of the list content), and give the Messages list the same placement.\n- No other change to the filter (its choices and the remembered choice stay as #899 made them).\n- The pager at the end of the list (#968, #898) is unchanged.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Messages: the filter scrolls with the list and leaves the screen with the large title.\n- [ ] Same structure as the category list. The device check goes to the general review (#893).\n\n### Related\n#899, #964, #977.",
