   "body": "/claim cloud/i1012-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- Read how `TopicListView` places the category filter (`ForumScopeBar`, a first row of the list content) and how `MessageListView` places the Tous / MP / MP multiples filter (#899).\n- Move the Messages filter into the list content, right under the large title row, so it scrolls away with the list; same structure as the category list.\n- No change to the filter's choices or its remembered choice; the pager (#968, #898) is untouched.\n- Test (Swift Testing) on whatever rule can be pulled out; draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus review. Note: PR #1017 also edits `MessageListView.swift` (one line each for the title tracker): a trivial conflict, to be resolved after the first merge.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
